# MedSync Health, Inc.
# 401(k) Plan Summary

## Plan Overview

MedSync Health offers a 401(k) retirement savings plan to all full-time employees. The plan is administered by a third-party provider.

## Eligibility

All full-time employees are eligible to participate in the 401(k) plan immediately upon hire.

## Employee Contributions

- Employees can contribute up to the IRS annual limit ($23,000 for 2026).
- Contributions can be made on a pre-tax or Roth (after-tax) basis.

## Employer Match

- MedSync Health matches 50% of employee contributions up to 6% of salary.
- Example: If you earn $100,000 and contribute 6% ($6,000), the company will contribute $3,000.

## Vesting

- Employee contributions are 100% vested immediately.
- Employer match vests over 4 years (25% per year).
